                <mxCell id="30" value="narrative:&lt;div&gt;1) client requests to liteproxy service with a given proxy url over https&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2) api gateway applies rate limiting and ssl temrination and servers the request over http to the api server&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3) api server checks if the request is cached in our redis instance if so return the cached response to the client&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4) if the proxied url isn&#39;t cached we send a request to the desired upstream&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5) we return the request to the api gateway still over http&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6) we return the request to the client&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
